## Deployed to /etc/default/prometheus-node-exporter.
## Loopback-only -- see prometheus.default's comment on --web.listen-address.
## Default collectors already cover cpu, memory, disk, io and network
## (cpu, meminfo, diskstats, filesystem, netdev); nothing extra to enable.
ARGS="--web.listen-address=127.0.0.1:9100"
